window.products.push({"id":245036,"name":"G G-WEI Wood Stove Fans 4 Blades Fireplace Fan 2019, 50°C Heating Silent Heat Powered Stove Fan for Wood/Log Burner/Fireplace, Wood Burning Eco-Friend","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DAtnCdrHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"G-WEI Heat Powered Stove Fan runs without batteries, cords or electricity, it generates its own power by the heat from the stove surface. Self-powered and Eco-Friendly The metal strip of the fan base transmits the heat to electricity generating units, and electricity generating units convert the heat energy into kinetic energy to drive the motor, then the blades spin. Feature: Ideal for use on all radiant wood fires and stoves Increase efficiency, circulates warm air throughout your room Self-powered and Eco-Friendly, cost nothing to operate Easy to install, place on a flat surfact away from flue Reduce your emission by burning 33% less fuel Maximum operating temperature range: 340ºC (644ºC)  Optimum operating temperature range: 80ºC-250ºC (176ºF-482ºC) Inbuilt protection system to stop the fan overheating Silent operation Product Details: Material: Anodized Aluminum Air Flow: 450CFM (Maximum) Running Speed: 1400RPM (Maximum) Height (Including blade): 190mm Width (Including blade): 180mm Product Weight: 600g Kindly Attention: 1. The optimum operating temperature range: 80ºC-250ºC (176ºF-482ºC), DON'T OVER 350ºC (662ºF) 2. Never place the fan on an unprotected surface if the fan base is still hot 3. Not recommended to move the fan when in use unless in an emergency. On the occasion, remember to wear gloves to protect against burns or injury by the rotating blades. 4. Keep all obstacles at a distance while the fan in use 5. Please ensure children and pets are supervised around your stove and the stove fan, and keep fan away from small children Package Included: 1 x Heat Powered Stove Fan 1 x User Manual 1 x Magnetic thermometer","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DAtnCdrHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"G G-WEI","source_asin":"B07GNB78FT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-245036","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GNB78FT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GNB78FT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":245037,"name":"G3337JW Jadeite Green Glass Large Range Size Jadite Salt & Pepper Shakers","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Pd4uEw9LL._AC_.jpg","description":"Jadeite Glass has been around since the 1920s or 30s and was very popular in the 1930s, 1950s and from 2000-present. This last bit of popularity was due to Martha Stewart and her love for Jadeite Glass. It is known as Jadeite, Jade-Ite, Jadite and Green Milk Glass. All different names but all the same. This is brand new glassware made in the old style. It is handmade (hand poured into molds) and may have minor mold imperfections/flaws due to the handmade process. This is all perfectly normal for the type of glassware it is and the way it is manufactured. Your product should have no chips and no cracks, but it may have straw marks, minor indentions, extra bumps of glass, etc. It is made in the same way as the old Depression glass so the flaws show up just like in the old, original depression era glassware","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Pd4uEw9LL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Memories General Store","source_asin":"B00NB6ZAVO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-245037","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00NB6ZAVO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00NB6ZAVO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
