window.products.push({"id":245133,"name":"Baking Cooling Rack - 100% Stainless Steel - Cool Cookies Cakes Breads - Oven Safe for Cooking Roasting Grilling - Commercial Quality 12x17 Heavy Duty","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bChlUd+tL._AC_SL1043_.jpg","description":"BUILT TO LAST! This heavy duty rack is engineered for strength and durability. It’s made of solid 100% stainless steel, 304 grade 18/8 steel alloy (8% nickel prevents rust). The strong wire frame is welded to a wire grid with perfect 3/8” spacing for strength and to hold small or delicate food. Three crossbars add strength while elevating the rack for optimal air circulation during cooking and cooling. It’s the heaviest wire cooling rack you can buy on Amazon at 1.6 pounds. It won’t rust or warp. Perfect fit for standard 13x18\" half sheet pans. CONCERNED ABOUT CONTAMINATION? Chrome plated racks can chip or flake. Non-stick surfaces can peel or leach bad chemicals. Aluminum and parchment paper can contaminate your food. Avoid all that with our 100% solid stainless steel rack that will assure clean and safe cooking. OVEN SAFE TO 575°F You can bake, cook, roast, or BBQ veggies and meats. Perfect veggies without cooking in puddles of oil. Evenly cooked chicken tenders without greasy bottoms, Perfect for nuts, bacon, crispy chicken and heavy cuts of meat. DISHWAHER SAFE! Will not rust! Cleanup is easy. Read the real customer reviews. YOU’VE HEARD OF ONE POT MEALS? Enter the world of ONE RACK DINNERS! Cook an entire meal on a rack. Faster and cleaner with distinct flavors for each food on the rack. NO SOGGY BOTTOMS! Even air flow perfectly cools cakes, cookies, breads and other baked goods. A MULTI TASKING TOOL , You can warm or cook pizza and other snacks with perfectly crisp crust, dry flower buds, herbs, or make crispy veggie and fruit chips. It’s a great trivet to protect counters and tables from hot pans. USE ON BBQ GRILL For confidence your food is clean - no grit, greasy smudgies, or burned on food to contaminate your awesome BBQ recipes! LIFETIME GUARANTEE","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bChlUd+tL._AC_SL1043_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Live-Nimble","source_asin":"B06WRRDHBX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-245133","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06WRRDHBX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06WRRDHBX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
