window.products.push({"id":245135,"name":"CIOEY Halloween Window Clings Crashing Witch Decals Window Decor Party Supplies, Pumpkin Spider Bats Cat Ghost Decorations Haunted House 4 Sheets Remo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81kliMtiusL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✦Super Value Pack: Comes in 4 sheets, total 42Pcs large clings, sheet size: 40cm x 30cm (16\" x12\"). Display size: 140cm x 120cm (55\" x47\"), you can DIY clings based on your own ideas in different locations and distances, because the decals are separated, works with windows of all sizes and shapes. ✦Unique Design: CIOEY Halloween window clings are special designed with classic patterns, such as a unique crashing witch, pumpkin, black cat, bat, Halloween candy etc,. So adorable that both kids and adults are keen on such Halloween widow decor. The witch hit design can add such a lovely addition to your Halloween party decorations! ✦Double-side Printed: These window clings are made of high quality transparent vinyl with double-side printed. When you paste them on the window, the same color effects displayed inside and outside of the window, a great eye-catching Halloween decorations! ✦Easy to Use: No glue, no tape, no mess! Clean the windows where needs to be pasted, spray a little water, and paste the window cling on. Please use it in flat and smooth places, such as class doors, windows, mirrors, refrigerator, ceramic tiles, etc,. Reusable window clings, remove without damage & residue, store these Halloween window clings for next year. ✦Wide Application: These Halloween decals are perfect decoration for windows of living room, playroom, nursery, haunted house, kids bedroom or Halloween party area. Wonderful Halloween clings to add a festival atmosphere for Halloween holiday, and the whole family, friends, neighbors will enjoy these lovely Halloween decorations!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81kliMtiusL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cioey","source_asin":"B0BNL7CP1B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-245135","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNL7CP1B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNL7CP1B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":245136,"name":"DHP Haven Small Space Sectional Sofa, Dark Gray Linen Futon,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":489.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HNZNbrC9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Glamour your home with the DHP haven small space sectional sofa futon. This simple and elegant sectional has a flawless design with a square-tufted backrest, slim track arms and black legs. It is made on a sturdy wooden frame and upholstered in your choice of linen or faux leather. The haven is compact enough to fit just about anywhere and it has a versatile construction that allows you to put the chaise on either side of the sofa. This beauty has also an adjustable backrest that can be reclined to lounging position or laid completely flat to create an additional bed for overnight guests. The haven is a must-have in your home! Available in multiple colors to offer the perfect option for your home décor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HNZNbrC9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DHP","source_asin":"B081VP7QS7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-245136","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081VP7QS7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B081VP7QS7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
