window.products.push({"id":245139,"name":"Shine Decor LED Strip Lights Dimmable 150FT/45M, SMD 120LEDs/M 110V-120V AC LED Rope Lights Outdoor 6500K Cool White, ETL-Listed IP65 Waterproof Cutta","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":189.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Zf7L-7IcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【120LEDS/M Illumination Lighting】Super high brightness of SMD2835 120LEDs/M, 19350lm 150ft led strip lights. Higher manufacturing skills of series-parallel wiring configuration make a more stable configuration and uniform glow distribution. This LED Strip Light is super bright and dimmable, but the dimmer and remote are not included, please check ASIN B07VGDJ6R1 for the dimmer controller pack, check ASIN B08B1N7P2L for the connectors accessory pack. 【ETL Standard Worth Money Quality】 Safe and reliable LED rope lights of ETL standard with fused plug, pure copper wire, more safe and reliable. Thick and premium tube coating made of anti-yellowing PVC, IP65 waterproof for both interior and exterior lighting scenes. SMD 2835 120LEDs/m of high brightness 430 Lumen, low power consumption to 5.3W/M. MAX. running 150ft strip light per power cord. Search ASIN B09J5274LN for aluminum channel track for this led strip lights. 【Ready for Use】 Plug & Play AC 110V-130V heavy-duty LED strip light with necessary accessories included, easy to install, plug & play without the need for a transformer. Flexible for ceiling and corner places, super soft and cozy 6500K cool white glow for bedroom indoor outdoor settings where need a bright and energetic glow. Visible quality brings your visitors a decent and quality feeling. Search ASIN B09J5274LN for aluminum channel track for this led strip lights. 【Cuttable & Waterproof】 Cuttable every 1.64ft/0.5m, please cut at the blank area where there are no LED beads, This outdoor rope lights led strip has durable anti-UV and IP65 waterproof tube coating for both interior and exterior use. Each power cord can run up to 150ft strip light without voltage drop, to buy an extra power cord kit, search B07Q5166NL. We suggest no cutting or splicing for longer service life. 【Multiple Use】 Are you a designer or DIY lover? Our led strip lighting lights has multiple features like cuttable, flexible, waterproof durable which will help open your imagination to create decent lighting decoration. Ideal linear design for all indoor and outdoor places wherever need an accent or ambiance lighting. Unroll the light strip coil before lighting on for test and installation, also a great choice of lighting decor for your Christmas gift scene to warm your family and sweet kids.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Zf7L-7IcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Shine Decor","source_asin":"B07XXWKG14","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-245139","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XXWKG14","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XXWKG14","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
