window.products.push({"id":245143,"name":"Lush Decor Lush Décor Grace Patchwork Sherpa Throw Blanket, 60\" x 50\", Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91nhOBZg-qL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Go back in time with this gorgeous patchwork throw. Detailed designs on each patch combined with the array of colors give this classical pattern a modern look. Perfect for any room in your home to give that vintage look.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91nhOBZg-qL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lush Decor","source_asin":"B01N2XOJV9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-245143","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N2XOJV9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N2XOJV9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":245144,"name":"Confetti Number 70 Silver, Gold - 2 Half Oz Bags (1 oz) #7702 Q01","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bIqkQ2kDL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Click the \"Visit the Jimmy Jems Store\" link near the Product Title at the top of the page, to Visit Our Amazon Store that lists over 500 Shapes and Colors of Confetti. .. The inventor of Metallic Confetti over 30 years ago in Los Angeles. All our Confetti is shipped to you FREE FREIGHT by USPS First Class or Priority Mail... Alittle something about this Jimmy Jems Confetti Style. Confidence is what this number is all about. At 70, I'll Celebrate just about anything!!. .. How many pieces of confetti per Half pound? The great unknown. Each confetti style has it own unique shape and thus area and weight, thus do not count. For example a 1/4 Square would weigh more than a 1/4\" Circle, and of course a 1/2\" Star, would weigh more than both. Then we have mixed shape confetti that would never have the same exact proportion of shapes per each lb. Lastly, the weight of the material we use sometimes fluctuates. NIGHTMARE!!! So, we decided from the beginning to sell by weight and not by volume or piece. But, for an example, Jimmy instructed the crew in the back to come up with some numbers and here it goes. Remember - this is an estimate ONLY. In a half pound there are approximately 25,000 - 1/4\" Circles, and 5,000 - 3/4\" Stars","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bIqkQ2kDL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jimmy Jem's","source_asin":"B09PBNNWB1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-245144","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PBNNWB1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PBNNWB1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
