window.products.push({"id":245394,"name":"KoaLovee Mastectomy Pillow,Zipper Pocket Seat Belt Pillow for Mastectomy / Hysterectomy Post Surgery Pad, Tummy Tuck Heart Surgery C-Section Recovery ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mFu2IyrKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"KoaLovee Seat Belt Pillow is excellent for post mastectomy and hysterectomy recovery, is a musthave after breast surgery, heart surgery, or Csection recovery. Its unique design makes it perfect for during the car ride and throughout the entire recovery process to protect sensitive areas from the seatbelt. MASTECTOMY % HYSTERECTOMY PILLOW SPECIFICATIONS: SIZE OPTIONS: ? S/M Dimensions: 14 x 6 x 2.5 inches ? L/XL Dimensions: 20 x 8 x 2.5 inches COLOR OPTIONS:; ? Bison ? Rose ? Anthracite KEY FEATURES: Although there is more filling with its specially designed 3D structure, a thinner and more elegant design is possible with KoaLovee compared to 2D products. 2 different size options. 100% Soft Baby Face Cotton Fabric, which is indispensable for our products, stands out with its very soft structure as well as being durable for all difficult usage conditions. With the erasable structure of our fabric, it is highly resistant to all kinds of stains and is very easy to wipe. KoaLovee has no middle seams that you see in others, so there is always a filling material on the line where the seat belt passes, and it makes the main task of protecting your surgical wounds at the highest level. Use as a ice / hot water thermos under the zipper, and you will experience relief in the chest or abdomen. Nonslip design that does not require seat belt fastening latches with 3 belt bands and silicone strips placed on each band. The handles placed on the strips are much simpler to fix or remove your pillow from the belt. Great Gift Idea Washable Outer Cover ? Attention: This is not a safety device, it only give you soft padding and protection from direct contact with the seat belt.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mFu2IyrKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B09RGJXF7M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-245394","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09RGJXF7M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09RGJXF7M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
