window.products.push({"id":245523,"name":"Rug Gripper, Upgraded Washable Removable Non Slip Rug Grippers, Double Sided Anti Curling Corner Carpet Tape, Keep Your Rug in Place","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41eU8GF8yBL._AC_.jpg","description":"How Long Will You Stand There Watching Your Messy Rugs Without Taking Action? Why tolerate a house in chaos when a single purchase can eliminate frustration, anger, and accidents immediately? Simply peel one side and stick them on a rug corner (2 tape grippers in \"V\" position on each), then peel the other side and place the rug whenever you want. That's it! No more curly rugs and runners. Forget about the constant aligning after your dog has stopped running around. Stop worrying about kids sliding on the runners, because after applying these they won't be able to! No more stumbling over raised corners at night. No more bruised arms, spilled jars, broken vases, and messy halls. Did you know that an estimated 38000 people (above 65) end up in the Emergency Department every single year due to unsecured carpets/rugs and curled edges? (according to the US National Library of Medicine) That doesn't include kids, people with disabilities and everyone else under 65! Minimize risk for everyone in your house today and never worry again about sliding, falling and getting hurt. Keep in mind that in addition to added protection, these large no-slip grippers provide a more organized environment for cleaning ( easier vacuuming, especially if you've got a robot vacuum ) and create an even, easily accessible path for wheelchairs and carts. AND, they come with an unconditional Full Money Back Guarantee! Click The \"Add To Cart\" Button NOW, Before This Premium Price Goes Up! Product Info: - 7.1 inches long, for maximum stability - 1.2 inches wide, for a better grip that withstands regular foot traffic - 0.1 inches thick, ensuring that no one will realize they even exist -Place only over smooth surfaces (not recommended for over-the-carpet rugs)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41eU8GF8yBL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ruispeed","source_asin":"B07DB23MYR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-245523","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DB23MYR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DB23MYR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
