window.products.push({"id":245560,"name":"Atelier Home Linen 3-Piece Bedding Sets - 100% Cotton Bed Sheets and Pillow Covers - Hotel Luxury 600 Thread Count Sateen Weave - Non-Wrinkle, No Fade","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":85.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QPlLEOr4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Having difficulty sleeping lately? The skies are dark. You lie in bed, wearing your most comfortable pajamas. Tired from a long day, you close your eyes hoping to doze off the moment you do...but you don't./br> You twist and turn, changing the position of your pillows while you're at it. Clearing your mind, you try again. After several minutes, you grunt in frustration. You're still awake and you know the reason why. Your scratchy bed covers and pillowcases are irritating! Start sleeping better with the luxury and comfort of Atelier Home Linen Cotton Sheet Set! The set includes 2 pillowcases, 1 bed sheet and 1 deep pocket sheet. All are sateen woven, single hem stitched, and made from 100% long-staple combed cotton grown in the Indian tropics. Each piece is guaranteed soft and smooth. With a 600 thread count, one of the highest on the market, it will wear well and become shinier over time. Our fabric is dyed with IMaster H20 to protect from shrinkage and fading. It also contributes to the cloth’s hypoallergenic quality. When washing, you can avoid wrinkling by drying naturally on the clothesline. Or tumble dry, sprinkle a few drops of water, and iron. At Atelier, we work from a 3rd generation factory with humble beginnings but can now compete with giant companies. We prefer not to mass produce to ensure that all our products pass the strictest standards before being delivered. Here are more reasons to love our cotton bedding set: ✨ Comes with a FREE hand towel ✨ Like hotel bedding, colors are solid without patterns or designs ✨ Choose from white, sky blue, beige, dark grey and dark lavender ✨ Sizes available: Twin, Queen, King, California King ✨ 100% money-back or replacement warranty! Enjoy well-deserved sleep every night. Add Atelier Home Linen Cotton Sheet Set to your cart TODAY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QPlLEOr4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sheets N More","source_asin":"B07CWR9XP3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-245560","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CWR9XP3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CWR9XP3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":245561,"name":"Mindful Design - Plug-In Wax Warmer - Blue Mosaic Glass - Pluggable Wax Melter Air Freshener and Night Light Lantern, Ideal for Bedrooms, Bathrooms, &","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YaZcTFymL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"GORGEOUS MOSAIC DESIGN - The crackled blue glass mosaic surface emits a soft glow, adding sparkle to every room it's placed in. Use as a nightlight in bedrooms, bathrooms, hallways and more! FITS ANY PLUG IN YOUR HOME - The compact plug-in size fits any room of the house, from bathrooms to kitchens and living rooms. Select your favorite scented melting wax, place in the reservoir at the top, and enjoy as the fragrance drifts through your home! FRESHEN YOUR SPACE - Parties, evenings at home or a Sunday of spring cleaning all call for a fresh scent to bring the ideal mood. A wax warmer is the perfect solution to bring pleasant aroma to your home without risk or worry. Plug-in design features a toggle switch to easily turn the unit off when you're leaving the room. Soy wax is recommended for best results. EASY MAINTENANCE - The wax holder at the top can be easily lifted off to clean or to gain access to the other parts of the warmer, and the metal form is a snap to wipe down. DIMENSIONS - Measures 4.9\" tall and 2.8\" wide. Included- 15 watt 120v NP7 bulb. Follow all provided safety instructions while operating the wax warmer. Wax melts not included.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YaZcTFymL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mindful Design","source_asin":"B09ZGCF2TT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-245561","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZGCF2TT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZGCF2TT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":245562,"name":"Freckled Sage Betty's Bunch Black Oilcloth Tablecloth with Yellow Gingham Trim You Pick The Size","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/912tb4LwSHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This delightful tablecloth is handmade in USA by Freckled Sage, the oilcloth experts! Using only genuine oilcloth this tablecloth is available in numerous sizes. These square and rectangular tablecloths are finished with gingham trim, which is also oilcloth. You pick the size and color! Don't be fooled by all the imitations, we only sell genuine oilcloth. Perfect for kitchen, picnics, pool side, and patios. Great for parties, holidays! Makes clean up a snap! Simply wipe clean! Measure your table then add the drop you'd like. For example if your table measures 38\" across, and you'd like a 5\" drop, add 10\" to your dimensions. That would give you a finished size of 48\". Then measure the length and do the same.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/912tb4LwSHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Freckled Sage Oilcloth Products","source_asin":"B01G4EN4ZS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-245562","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01G4EN4ZS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01G4EN4ZS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":245563,"name":"Glaver's Beer Glasses Set of 6 British 19 Oz. Pint Glasses, Uniquely Designed Easy-Grip European Pub Beer Pilsner Tumblers for Wheat, Ale, Juice, Cock","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814FGl6gdBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MULTIPURPOSE BEER DRINKING GLASSES: The stylish and simple Beer Tasting Glasses will make drinking a pleasure! Our Tumblers hold up to 19 ounces of beer. It’s not just a beer glass, they are also great universal drinking glasses of water, juice, ice coffee, soda, cocktails, or your favorite beverage. PERFECT GIFT IDEA FOR BEER LOVERS: Trying to think of a gift to give to a beer lover in your life? These high-end Turkey Beer tumblers are sure to impress. They come neatly presented ready to be gifted. DISHWASHER SAFE: You can either hand wash each glass cup or toss them in the dishwasher after each use. The glass is thick and durable, so it is highly resistant to chips and scratches. Our Glass Cups are guaranteed to withstand the test of time. VERSATILE SHAPE - The modern shape equally good for family celebrations and informal meetings. The glass widens upward to help emphasize the beer aroma, and is easy to grasp and comfortable in the hand. REPLACEMENT GUARANTEE: We are confident that our glasses are made with superior quality and have solid packaging, however, if you are not completely satisfied or your glass happens to break, please do not hesitate to contact us. We will do everything to make it right.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814FGl6gdBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Glaver's","source_asin":"B09T4K3YSX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-245563","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09T4K3YSX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09T4K3YSX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
