window.products.push({"id":245694,"name":"Cuisinart Truffle and Chocolate Shaver, 1.25\", Stainless Steel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.04,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/517nW-nng2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Cuisinart specialty collection was inspired by top chefs to provide professional-quality gourmet tools for the home kitchen. This Stainless Steel Truffle shaver is the perfect tool for making consistent slices of Truffles, cheeses, chocolate, garlic, vegetables, and more. The blade easily adjusts to a variety of thicknesses to use with any recipe. Also includes recipes and tips for how to select, store, and use Truffles.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/517nW-nng2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cuisinart","source_asin":"B078YQHX2P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-245694","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B078YQHX2P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B078YQHX2P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
