window.products.push({"id":245704,"name":"Bloss Blackout Window Film One Way Privacy Daytime 100% UV Light Blocking Window Tint Non-Adhesive Removable Mirror Film for Home and Office, Dark Bla","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":31.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qSTk0GtLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Extraordinary Daytime Privacy: Bloss black out window film can create a blackout environment for you at daytime. Better privacy protection and darker place for day sleep. The side with stronger light will appear mirror effect, so when lights turn on at night you can see mirror effect inside while outside people can see through the film. So remember close the curtain at night. Anti-Uv Damage & Excellent Sun Blocking：Bloss one way window film is designed to block out 98% UV rays and 90% of infrared rays. In summer, this film not only can block part of heat through you house, but also protect your furniture from aging. Lower VLT (Visible Light Transmittance) ensures that glare and strong sunlight will not bother you. Non-Adhesive Static Cling Design: Our reflective window film designed with NO GLUE, easier for you to clean and install. Static cling film is more friendly to glass surface. For installation, just spray some water/soap water on the glass surface and the backside of static film, and definitely will not damage glass surface when you take it off. 100% no residue. !!! Put the side of the transparent film you tore up against the window!!! Multiple Applications: Our film is suitable for plenty of scenes, such as office door and window, house windows, kitchen glass, balcony, and rest room. Please make sure that the glass surface completely clean and smooth when installation. Do not use in double-paned glass, frosted glass or other uneven glass. 100% Satisfied After-Sale Services: We want to give you the best window blackout film and customer services. If there is any question, contact us and our service team will solve it for you ASAP. Your feedback helps ensure we keep doing things right. Don’t hesitate start to decorate your home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qSTk0GtLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bloss","source_asin":"B0B5L7RYCB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-245704","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5L7RYCB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5L7RYCB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":245705,"name":"chongqing 12PCS Christmas Snowflake Coaster, Red Snowflake Felt Coaster, Christmas Theme Party Design, Winter Holiday Dinner Decoration","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811PiWfs33L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Merry Christmas! ! ! Snowflake designed for Christmas made of felt. Features Snowflakes designed for Christmas. Made of felt. The diameter of the Christmas snowflake coaster is 10cm / 3.93in. The Christmas snowflake coaster is made of high-quality felt fabric to keep your desktop dry and clean Effect Perfect for Christmas interior decorations, you can also use them as gifts for friends. The package includes 12 coasters. Suitable for many occasions, such as New Year's party, Christmas party, family party, etc. Add a Christmas atmosphere, very cute coasters. With green and red colors, you can hang them on windows or walls for decoration. Specification Material: felt Quantity: 12 pieces Color: red Size: 10cm / 3.93in (diameter) Package includes. 12 Christmas snowflake coasters in 4 styles","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811PiWfs33L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"chongqing","source_asin":"B09DKCJ9GG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-245705","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DKCJ9GG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DKCJ9GG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
