window.products.push({"id":245710,"name":"BATTIFE 9Pack Streamers Poppers - Colorful Hand Throw Streamers Poppers, No Mess Paper Crackers for Birthday Wedding Party Celebrations, Multi-Color","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.8,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lBq5FctiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Romantic and Special - Bright, colorful and easy to clean up after all the fun is over, use hand throw streamers poppers to make a grand wedding exit, made guests feel like an important part of the ceremony and provided for a great photo opportunity! Plus, you can easily incorporate your wedding party by put the streamers together as a DIY. Great for Celebrations -Immerse yourself and your guests in colorful tissue streamers; make amazing photos and selfie moments with colorful tissue streamers floating around; surprise your family and friends on their wedding, birthday, christmas, new year eve party, graduation party, championship games, award ceremony, champion party or any other celebration party. Easy to Use - First of all, use one finger to hold the ring of popper, then tear the paper in the bottom of streamers, then hold the streamers in your hand, throw them away like a magic trick when the party is on. It's great for party decoration, easy to pop out, no mess and easy to clean up after party. Eco-Friendly - We do care about environment, all of our pop out party streamers are made of tissue paper which is ECO friendly. Size & Quantity - There are 9 packs colorful streamers in total, and each crackers poppers has 20pcs streamer inside, and the length of each streamer is approx 6 meters, invite your friends or your kids to play together.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lBq5FctiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BATTIFE","source_asin":"B0BG3RXSRB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-245710","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BG3RXSRB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BG3RXSRB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
