window.products.push({"id":245759,"name":"Elviros Cervical Memory Foam Neck Pillow for Side Sleeping, Contour Orthopedic Pillows for Back and Stomach Sleepers, Adjustable Ergonomic Bed Pillow ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":45.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WpjH1Oq-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌙4 ADJUSTABLE CUSTOMIZED HEIGHT: This cervical pillow has a medium soft feel designed with removable memory foam inserts (about 0.8\" thick) for varied types of sleepers. Simply remove the bottom insert of memory foam to customize the height level. Additionally, rotating the pillow 180° provides a different level for low pillow sleepers. This construction makes it easy to switch between an orthopedic pillow and an ordinary pillow. 🌙2 IN 1 MULTI-FUNCTIONAL DESIGN: Combines a Cervical Pillow and a bed Pillow in One, which means that you have 2 types of pillows for one purchase. 2 areas for different demands: If you have spine and neck discomfort, we recommend you to use our cervical profile pillow. The neck support area provides a custom fit and aligns your head and neck in a way that leaves your airways open. (At the beginning, you may not be used to it, so it is recommended that you give yourself 1-2 weeks to adapt to it); If your spine is healthy again, or if you are a healthy person, you can use our Bed Pillow. 🌙ERGONOMIC CONTOUR DESIGN: This ergonomic spine pillow has the best balance of support and comfort. It will uniquely match the shape of your head and neck, making sure you get perfectly supporting and aligning your head, neck, shoulders, and back, that lasts throughout the night. . The cervical pillow will help you reduce pain and stress, allowing you to breathe more freely and sleep more soundly. 🌙AWAY FROM NECK & SHOULDER PAIN: Expertly designed to offer to confirm support, relieve the pain in the neck, shoulder and back and reduce insomnia, a cervical pillow for neck pain could make you feel comfortable and restful with zero pressure. Provides therapeutic relief for all sleepers and neck pain. Try it for a new level of comfort whether you are a back sleeper, stomach sleeper, or side sleeper. You will wake up feeling fully recharged and ready to take the day. 🌙CertiPUR-US SAFE & ODORLESS MEMORY FOAM: This neck support pillow is made with high-density slow rebound memory foam which is certified by CertiPUR-US and approved by Oeko-Tex. It provides maximum comfort without any harmful substance and maintains its shape. Its temperature sensing, makes the pillow FITS YOUR NECK perfectly. NOTE: NEVER WASH THE MEMORY FOAM. 🌙REMOVABLE BREATHABLE PILLOWCASE: The neck support pillowcase is made of 100% polyester and 3D mesh fiber that allows heat to escape and fresh air to cycle in. feels soft, not fleece, non-pilling, very breathable, skin-friendly, and keeps the pillow cool while you sleep. The cover is easily removable with a durable zipper and is machine washable for easy cleaning and hygiene. All materials are improved health. An ideal gift for family and friends.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WpjH1Oq-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Elviros","source_asin":"B0B6YNLDSD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-245759","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B6YNLDSD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B6YNLDSD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
