window.products.push({"id":245787,"name":"Panba Wood Bead Garland Boho Decor Prayer Beads with Tassel Farmhouse Rustic Home Coffee Table Decor Prayer Beads Decoration Modern Farm Country Decor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":5.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uct2uapuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[FRESH FARMHOUSE DECOR NO POLLUTANT] Panba wood bead garland is made of quality Russian log, which is better clean than other weedtree wood. No pollutant, no bad smell and no color running problems. Thanks for the Russian wood, our wooden beads are solid and full round shapes. [FAITHFUL HOME DCEOR] It is believed that prayer beads and jute ropes represent faith and peace, bring luck to your family. More and more house decor blogger are posting their fashion rustic home decor with this wood garland. It perfects all kinds of modern farmhouse decor. [FLEXIBLE BOHO DECOR] Unlike poor farmhouse garlands, Panba leave certain gap between beads to ensure the flexibility. You can easily style this wooden beads garland to hang or round on pampas glass vases, macrame baskets, shelf and tiered trays. Panba bead garland also goes on well with theme hotel or restaurants or cafes decor that would warmly welcome your guests. [WIDE APPLICATION] Panba farmhouse garland is a popular ornament for festivals and parties. It can be Christmas Trees and Easter decorations or Turkey Plates display, help to increase charm of festival ritual. [ALL-MATCH HOME DECORATION SIZE]Panba boho garland is 58 inch/ 147 cm long, with total 84 beads each 0.63 inch/ 1.6 mm. Two strings through each decorative beads design makes farmhouse tassel strong for long time hanging.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uct2uapuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Panba","source_asin":"B09N8T2Y39","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-245787","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09N8T2Y39","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09N8T2Y39","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
