window.products.push({"id":245843,"name":"Mawa by Reston Lloyd Reverse Hook Trouser Series Non-Slip Space-Saving Clothes Hanger with Single Rod for Pants, Style KH/35U, Set of 10, Silver","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LxEUaUiPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"In 1948 Martin Wagner had the vision to manufacture the best clothes hanger in the world. That dream became a fully automated manufacturing process that combines specialized machinery, professional designers/engineers, and experienced sales staff. Mawa pioneered the market with patented technology such as turn able hooks, anti-slip coating, and clip hangers. Mawa delivers 100% \"made in Germany\" clothes hangers to 58 countries to ensure high quality materials and designs are offered throughout the world. Managing director, Michaela Schenk has made consumer safety her top priority. All materials used for production can be recycled and water consumption in the manufacturing process has been reduced by 80%. Mawa is environmental friendly and certified in accordance with Germany's strict ecologic standards. The culmination of European standards and Mawa dedication to high standards, results in a product which is not hazardous to the customer or planet. Our non-slip reverse trouser hanger is perfect for organizing pants. The trouser hanger will not put folds or creases in your pants, regardless of the material. This reverse 18248 was created to allow you to take your pants off the hanger without even unhooking the hanger. Just grab and go! the modern shape allows you to see each item while hung in the closet. Each hanger will hang at the same height as all other models of Mawa hangers, creating a uniform look. All Mawa products hang uniformly to create an even neat look. Your clothes do not need to suffer, and neither does your wallet. Take care of your clothes by using the Mawa line of hangers. Save space, get organized and treat your garments & yourself with the utmost care.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LxEUaUiPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MAWA","source_asin":"B0BSMNFJJH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-245843","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BSMNFJJH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BSMNFJJH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
