window.products.push({"id":245989,"name":"Nourison Tranquil Floral Turquoise 4' x 6' Area -Rug, Easy -Cleaning, Non Shedding, Bed Room, Living Room, Dining Room, Kitchen (4x6)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.67,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1TSXA6qmGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Nourison's Tranquil Collection brings together a palette of soothing and elegant colors into an assortment of contemporary and traditional patterns, ranging from contemporary florals to intricate Persian and Kashan bordered medallion rugs. Each rug features a lush cut pile in easy-care fibers, with subtle abrash tones for touch of calming charm for any decor. An elegant and detailed floral motif makes this Tranquil Collection area rug an ideal choice to bring a French country aesthetic to any room. Its pleasing palette combines shades of turquoise and touches of pink detailing, in soft easy-care fibers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1TSXA6qmGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nourison","source_asin":"B07SLG21KN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-245989","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SLG21KN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07SLG21KN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":245990,"name":"Hot Air Balloon Butterfly Artwork by Nicole Dietz, 12 by 24-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":47.26,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vP-Bw89xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features a hot air balloon, decorated with spots and stripes, with a green butterfly against an abstract background. Nicole Dietz is an Ohio-based artist and her works reflect her love of travel with common motifs of trees and nature scenes. A bold color palette and abstract landscapes reflect her strong graphic design background. Her best selling editions, 'The White Series', has seen international popularity and the starkness of her pieces has shown a following among starter collections as well as established galleries. Nicole's pursuit of custom artwork installations has kept her style fresh and always evolving. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vP-Bw89xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00LSL6IQU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-245990","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00LSL6IQU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00LSL6IQU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
